## Mandatory preconditions

1. Exact-head compile/test receipt.
2. Dependency audit with zero admitted high/critical vulnerabilities.
3. SBOM, immutable digest, signature, and provenance attestation.
4. Migration dry-run and semantic-drift classification.
5. OBDA behavioral parity on the exact semantic subject.
6. Load/error-budget evidence for the admitted workload class.
7. Multi-zone failover and DR replay receipts.
8. Separately receipted rollback plan.
9. Explicit release authority outside this generated artifact.

## Strategy

{% if release == "canary" %}
1% → 10% → 50% → 100%, with an evidence checkpoint at every transition.
{% elif release == "blue_green" %}
Green shadow → exact-subject parity → explicit cutover receipt → green active.
{% elif release == "cell_progressive" %}
First cell → one region → half of admitted cells → all cells, preserving blast-radius bounds.
{% else %}
Rolling replacement with zero-unavailable intent and evidence-driven abort conditions.
{% endif %}

Abort on error-budget burn, semantic parity mismatch, receipt mismatch, tenant-isolation failure, or recovery-bound failure.
